  "bodyHash": "oWd6Z+qgbC4=",
  "content": "<hr><h1>安装指南（非常重要）</h1><p>（如果您使用的tacz版本低于1.14，部分文件夹位于.minecraft/config/tacz中）</p><ol>\n<li>安装最新版本的<strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffiles.minecraftforge.net%252fnet%252fminecraftforge%252fforge%252findex_1.20.1.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forge</a></strong></li>\n<li>安装<strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create</a></strong>版本0.5.1.f或更高版本。</li>\n<li>安装<strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/timeless-and-classics-zero\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Timeless and Classics Zero</a>。</strong></li>\n<li>启动Minecraft，以便Timeless and Classics Zero创建其目录。</li>\n<li>安装<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/customization/tacz-create-armorer-koei\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Create Armorer</strong></a>并将.zip文件放入.minecraft/tacz文件夹中。</li>\n<li>将此模组安装到mod文件夹中。</li>\n</ol><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>可选步骤：移除枪械工作台的Create Armorer合成配方（推荐）</strong></p><ol>\n<li>将.minecraft/tacz/tacz-pre.toml中的DefaultPackDebug选项改为true。</li>\n<li>进入.minecraft/tacz文件夹，打开您下载的create armorer压缩包（可使用winrar）。删除data/create_armorer/recipes中的recipes文件夹。</li>\n</ol><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>额外步骤：删除所有原版工作台合成配方</strong></p><p>3. 进入.minecraft/tacz/tacz_default_gun/data/tacz文件夹，删除recipes文件夹。</p><hr><p><strong>寻找更多枪械包整合？</strong>查看这个Immersive Armorer的附加组件！</p><p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-immersive-armorer-integration\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1152431/description_9ae2fdde-5b4b-4537-9c95-a5094c0f5fda.png\" alt=\"\"></a></p><h4><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/978675/description_0c80647f-43e3-48ee-bce9-f81d45f49717.png\" alt=\"\"></h4><p>&nbsp;</p><p>本模组添加了将Create Armorer中的枪械、弹药和配件<strong>合成与自动化</strong>的方法，融入沉浸式的Create体验。</p><p>现在枪械的合成配方更加真实，弹药可以批量生产！</p><p>仅推荐使用Create Armorer武器，因为它们最适合Create玩法流程。</p><h1><strong>新的枪械部件！</strong></h1><p>新增了作为武器合成中间步骤的物品。</p><h2><strong>枪管</strong></h2><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1152431/description_36f3266e-045b-427f-b979-27789e517598.png\" alt=\"\"></p><h2><strong>扳机机构</strong></h2><h2><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1152431/description_103ef41c-451e-4cf0-ad75-f0c28994507b.png\" alt=\"\"></h2><h2><strong>击发机构</strong></h2><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1152431/description_ff84806d-929a-43b5-9405-84dcb0881e25.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><h1><strong>新的枪械合成配方！</strong></h1><p>由于TaCZ武器相比常规Minecraft和Create武器更为强大，合成配方已使用新的枪械部件进行平衡。现在您需要精密机械组件和机械合成器等部件来制作它们。</p><h2><strong>新的“扭矩”左轮手枪配方</strong></h2><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1152431/description_d9e08f66-0a87-4cfe-81de-0ff451cf3d78.png\" alt=\"\"></p><h2><strong>新的“应力”自动手枪配方</strong></h2><h2><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1152431/description_9131c5d3-5e0a-4eff-bf3e-d089a10aa2fd.png\" alt=\"\"></h2><h2><strong>新的“发条”狙击枪配方</strong></h2><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1152431/description_83a42696-94d5-4991-a3bf-2bc52727dd26.png\" alt=\"\"></p><h2><strong>新的“起重机”突击步枪配方</strong></h2><h2><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1152431/description_0e078480-ad24-4706-998f-64acab261c06.png\" alt=\"\"></h2><h2><strong>新的“石制”霰弹枪配方</strong></h2><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1152431/description_af175836-e08d-403c-b556-471bb7139303.png\" alt=\"\"></p><h2><strong>新的“轴承”霰弹枪配方</strong></h2><h1><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1152431/description_73c15fe9-1676-415b-83a1-9a8ec64ad949.png\" alt=\"\"></h1><h2><strong>新的“曲柄”冲锋枪配方</strong></h2><h1><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1152431/description_27e18b1e-2993-4ed2-8c7a-4ed24b3e4225.png\" alt=\"\"></h1><h2><strong>新的“飞轮”机枪配方</strong></h2><h1><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1152431/description_7492801b-094b-47fe-98e1-ea6e69243575.png\" alt=\"\"></h1><h2><strong>新的“原子破坏者”近战武器配方</strong></h2><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1152431/description_52ff91f8-5d03-4817-a200-50349df65e5f.png\" alt=\"\"></p><h2><strong>新的“扳手”近战武器配方</strong></h2><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1152431/description_83c10937-0f2c-47a6-a78c-3e8a8ef8b83f.png\" alt=\"\"></p><h1><strong>新的枪械配件合成配方！</strong></h1><p>一把枪没有<strong>配件</strong>是不完整的，因此添加了更多制作配方的合成方法。</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1152431/description_8f7c5f15-6668-43d2-9d2d-af53cc5b0c14.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1152431/description_05f62b62-2cbf-4a2f-9c06-ed5fcd8a3c43.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1152431/description_deaa98a9-bd11-4140-911f-2c723c8579c0.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1152431/description_c4a41a2f-a87f-4e65-bf62-c4fe9c21092b.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1152431/description_9461e2d1-523b-4aa3-b466-c091d509b820.png\" alt=\"\"> &nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1152431/description_a5c6e183-61d7-484b-9b2f-06a085f49258.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1152431/description_518867cc-7d22-43f7-b162-417928b8a48a.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1152431/description_e98f9d80-ccf0-4719-8327-e5dfcdd53175.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1152431/description_c6e654b6-9a8b-45a4-bea6-8acd7d412305.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1152431/description_3aed786c-354a-4f30-ae06-e85cc30e9f44.png\" alt=\"\"> &nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1152431/description_2a34660d-25d7-43a5-9737-4709f7c9b1aa.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1152431/description_579af3cb-4934-4cb5-bb0a-e1be07933d28.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1152431/description_032ac40d-838f-41ab-ba46-dbf2a82321c3.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1152431/description_b9f7632e-237f-46ee-825f-067298ed5471.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1152431/description_3836dacd-6c1c-4c6c-9303-6ebede5a360a.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1152431/description_8b60fdca-76c0-4d80-b3bf-527a5b8743bd.png\" alt=\"\"></p><h1><strong>新的弹药壳！</strong></h1><p><strong>弹药壳</strong>通过锯切黄铜板制成。您可以使用JEI过滤器选择特定类型的弹壳，使其将板材切割成该类型。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1152431/description_3b40259a-2da4-46f3-bbc5-54365fc5c349.png\" alt=\"\"></p><h1><strong>新的流体！</strong></h1><p><strong>火药</strong>现在可以作为流体存储在储罐中，并用于不同的合成配方。如果您安装了<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-big-cannons\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create Big Cannons</a>，还可以存储<strong>硝化火药</strong>，它在制作底火时比火药更高效。</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1152431/description_bf3d69cb-12f3-4976-a02d-aae6558ac1af.png\" alt=\"\"> &nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1152431/description_09c7285c-e7c8-45de-8bfe-8741c552580f.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><h1><strong>新的弹药合成配方！</strong></h1><p>制作弹药需要<strong>底火</strong>。这些是通过将火药或硝化火药注入安山合金壳中制成的。</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1152431/description_9bfa81c9-a5df-42b6-8529-75e6c390987f.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1152431/description_e3120cf5-efc0-4422-ad7d-55e4d655a8f5.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p>现在您有了底火，可以将它们插入弹壳并填充火药，以制作您选择的弹药类型。</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1152431/description_07bc5695-766a-47bd-8aa8-f7ca6465a4b2.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p>您需要黄铜来制造枪械和生产弹药，因此在尝试建立新的枪械工厂时，请确保已达到该技术水平。</p><p>除此之外，该过程需要大量安山合金，因为每个底火都需要一个合金，因此请确保至少自动化该生产过程。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><hr><h1>常见问题</h1><p>问：启动游戏时出现错误。</p><p>答：尝试更新Forge到较新版本。</p><p>问：使用锯子时合成了其他物品。</p><p>答：这意味着有其他模组使用了相同的合成配方。在锯子上使用过滤器，使其仅输出您需要的物品。</p><p>本模组主要为个人使用而制作，但如果您对需要进行的更改有任何建议，欢迎在评论中提出！</p><hr><p>&nbsp;</p><h2 style=\"text-align:left\"><strong>查看我的其他模组！</strong></h2><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcreate-mechanical-companion\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1264989/description_609b037b-78cb-4497-8b4f-c95c77def773.png\" alt=\"image\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1152431/description_3eebc495-7c50-4bec-9c5b-43b13ec09ac0.png\" alt=\"\"></a></p><p>想要报告错误、分享评测、建议功能并获取游戏更新？加入我们的官方Discord频道！</p><p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/jWqsA8EPeC\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/978675/description_4336ae1a-a280-4da5-8faa-7588ff631da4.png\" width=\"109\" height=\"109\"></a></p><p>如果您喜欢这个模组并希望支持其开发，捐赠将不胜感激 ❤️<br><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fmarcosjoestar\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1264989/description_a58064f4-0c7b-475f-b0f8-83767c242bd8.png\"></a></p>",
